{"4228900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BreakLoop","steam_appid":4228900,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BreakLoop is a time survival, deckbuilding roguelike with retro gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228900\/extras\/479e6c1968528c8d092e7772d296de60.avif?t=1779944561\" width=780 height=90 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless horde of bricks is invading the paddle kingdom. You are the last line of defense. Defeat bricks to level up and upgrade your weapons or buy items that synergise in ways that let you ANIHILATE your opposition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228900\/extras\/22af8eaaef52a56e97494fa8a9ce4507.avif?t=1779944561\" width=250 height=396 \/><\/span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228900\/extras\/b9b9f7b25ed79dcb9cc4930de65b776a.avif?t=1779944561\" width=250 height=396 \/><\/span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228900\/extras\/283d89c93704201a51ba97a8ddb23308.avif?t=1779944561\" width=250 height=397 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly replayable. Replay the game with different cores and difficulties or even try one of the challenge runs if you think you're up to it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Every item you unlock and weapon you buy can make or break your run, you have to think about your options carefully to succeed<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr